      "title": "Notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Sharpen\n\nUnsharp mask with ComfyUI's ImageSharpen: boosts edge contrast, adds no new detail, no model. Instant at any size.\n\n- **Load Image**: pick or upload the image. Transparency is kept.\n- **Image Sharpen**: **alpha** is the strength, and small values go a long way. 0.05 is subtle, 0.1 clearly crisper, past ~0.2 halos and grain show. **sharpen_radius** 1 sharpens fine detail, 2-3 broader edges (halos sooner); **sigma** softens the blur the mask is built from.\n- For blurry, noisy or compressed images, use seedvr2-upscale.json at scale 1 instead: it restores detail rather than exaggerating what's there.\n- The compare node slides between the input and the result. Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded."
      ]
    }
